Welcome to TappyPlane. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect information when you use our mobile game.

1. Information We Collect

TappyPlane itself does not collect personally identifiable information directly from users. However, third-party services used in the game may collect certain information automatically, including:

* Device information
* Advertising ID
* IP address
* Country and language settings
* Gameplay activity
* Crash reports and diagnostics

2. Advertising

TappyPlane displays third-party advertisements to support the game.

We may use advertising providers such as:

* Google AdMob￼

These providers may use cookies, advertising identifiers, and similar technologies to show personalized or non-personalized ads.

You can learn more about how Google uses data here:

* How Google Uses Information from Apps and Sites￼

3. Analytics and Crash Reporting

We may use third-party analytics or crash reporting services to improve gameplay experience and app stability.

These services may collect:

* Device type
* Operating system version
* Gameplay session information
* Crash logs

4. Children’s Privacy

TappyPlane is not directed toward children under the age of 13.

We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided personal data, please contact us so we can remove the information.

5. Data Security

We take reasonable measures to protect user information and work only with trusted third-party providers. However, no method of electronic storage or transmission is completely secure.

6. Third-Party Services

The game may contain links or integrations to third-party services. Their privacy practices are governed by their own privacy policies.

Examples include:

* Google Privacy Policy￼

7. Your Choices

Depending on your region and device settings, you may:

* Reset your advertising ID
* Limit ad personalization
* Disable personalized ads through device settings

8. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.

